<h1>Average 40-Yard Dash for a <em>15 Year Old</em></h1>
<div class="hero-meta">
<span class="hero-meta-item">📊 Sprint Speed · Age 15</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">🏈 Football · Recruiting</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">📅 Updated July 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="hero-intro">
    The average 40-yard dash for a 15-year-old male is 5.4 to 5.8 seconds. For females it is 6.0 to 6.6 seconds. At 15 you are a sophomore — recruiting is still mostly ahead of you, but this is the best time to establish your baseline and start building. Here is what counts as average, fast, and elite at this age and exactly how much room remains to improve.
  </p>
